# Everything in this repository ends up on a Linux host: scripts run under
# bash, config files are bind-mounted into Linux containers. A Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF, and
# real bash then fails outright on `set -euo pipefail\r` ("invalid option
# name"); a CRLF systemd unit hands a carriage return to ExecStart. Force LF
# for every text file, whatever the checking-out machine's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never normalized or diffed as text.
*.p12   binary
*.jks   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.zip   binary
*.pdf   binary
dmss-archive-services/cacerts/cacerts binary
